Error [E0112]: `transform` wants fn(Int) Int -[]> for argument 2, but this is fn(n: Int) Int
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_callback_bound_precedence.jet:12:28
    |
 12 |     r :: transform([1, 2], noisy)
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: use fn(Int) Int -[]> here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112

